{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards and Dungeons is a roguelike dungeon crawler that blends strategic card play with fast-paced action. Choose your hero, equip your deck, and descend through ever-changing dungeons filled with monsters, traps, and brutal bosses. Every run is a test of survival, strategy, and risk management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/ebda3e3dd88eb28bcf99e4390d40d0b6.poster.avif?t=1772737153\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/ebda3e3dd88eb28bcf99e4390d40d0b6.webm?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/ebda3e3dd88eb28bcf99e4390d40d0b6.mp4?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR HERO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure with one of several heroes, each armed with a distinctive ability and playstyle. Unlock more characters as you progress, opening new ways to conquer the dungeon. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has a basic attack, but true power comes from the cards you assign. Equip up to three cards per run\u2014ranging from devastating attacks to tactical abilities\u2014and use mana to unleash them in battle. Beware: every card played pushes a hidden counter forward, and once it triggers, a random punishment will strike. Cards give you immediate strength, but carry long-term risks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/9eaa0106f32407351dc30fc94f62ad4d.poster.avif?t=1772737153\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/9eaa0106f32407351dc30fc94f62ad4d.webm?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/9eaa0106f32407351dc30fc94f62ad4d.mp4?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCEND INTO DEADLY DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated floors offer fresh challenges every run. Encounter dangerous biomes, shifting layouts, cunning traps, and enemies that become deadlier the deeper you go. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll face powerful bosses guarding the path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT, UPGRADE, AND GROW STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold to purchase upgrades, mana to power your abilities, and experience gems to level up your heroes. Between runs, expand your arsenal with new cards, improve your characters, and unlock permanent upgrades to push even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/6598de367552735d7ad9b2988a672cd0.poster.avif?t=1772737153\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/6598de367552735d7ad9b2988a672cd0.webm?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/6598de367552735d7ad9b2988a672cd0.mp4?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple heroes, hundreds of card combinations, random events, punishing drawbacks, and procedurally generated dungeons, no two runs are ever the same. Test your strategies, refine your builds, and challenge higher difficulties as you master the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon awaits\u2014will you conquer the final floor, or be lost to the depths?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win a run playing as Arthur.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/665d378a5da84724c9fd67646c103b2a7916fd61.jpg"},{"name":"Win a run playing as Arwen.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/31792b5a282cddc4d924c0eaab4a3694cb725cb7.jpg"},{"name":"Win a run playing as Thorin.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/9698b0503518b96a3abc927c2eb237adaf378445.jpg"},{"name":"Win a run playing as Mary.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/b7d01d25edb638fac832404244d3707278542461.jpg"},{"name":"Win a run on easy difficulty.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/40423844f7d1f6e4eaac147e25d4548c42ce85c6.jpg"},{"name":"Win a run on medium difficulty.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/d6049bd822597c14ed902037e22505e4392f9ab3.jpg"},{"name":"Win a run on hard difficulty.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/d7be191f84be524187feb6dba97341312d5a066a.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat 5000 enemies.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2968290/6a4755a8dc0154f389486d0d98c88bc7d40a28ab.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968290?t=1772737153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/a77d14e9ac21a7d86f065522131df35a895b0b8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772737153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/311c1aac4a4958748b10e618d6ad1bf0db318c32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772737153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/311c1aac4a4958748b10e618d6ad1bf0db318c32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772737153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards and Dungeons is a roguelike dungeon crawler that blends strategic card play with fast-paced action. Choose your hero, equip your deck, and descend through ever-changing dungeons filled with monsters, traps, and brutal bosses. Every run is a test of survival, strategy, and risk management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/ebda3e3dd88eb28bcf99e4390d40d0b6.poster.avif?t=1772737153\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/ebda3e3dd88eb28bcf99e4390d40d0b6.webm?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/ebda3e3dd88eb28bcf99e4390d40d0b6.mp4?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR HERO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure with one of several heroes, each armed with a distinctive ability and playstyle. Unlock more characters as you progress, opening new ways to conquer the dungeon. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has a basic attack, but true power comes from the cards you assign. Equip up to three cards per run\u2014ranging from devastating attacks to tactical abilities\u2014and use mana to unleash them in battle. Beware: every card played pushes a hidden counter forward, and once it triggers, a random punishment will strike. Cards give you immediate strength, but carry long-term risks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/9eaa0106f32407351dc30fc94f62ad4d.poster.avif?t=1772737153\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/9eaa0106f32407351dc30fc94f62ad4d.webm?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/9eaa0106f32407351dc30fc94f62ad4d.mp4?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCEND INTO DEADLY DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated floors offer fresh challenges every run. Encounter dangerous biomes, shifting layouts, cunning traps, and enemies that become deadlier the deeper you go. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll face powerful bosses guarding the path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT, UPGRADE, AND GROW STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold to purchase upgrades, mana to power your abilities, and experience gems to level up your heroes. Between runs, expand your arsenal with new cards, improve your characters, and unlock permanent upgrades to push even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/6598de367552735d7ad9b2988a672cd0.poster.avif?t=1772737153\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/6598de367552735d7ad9b2988a672cd0.webm?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/extras/6598de367552735d7ad9b2988a672cd0.mp4?t=1772737153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple heroes, hundreds of card combinations, random events, punishing drawbacks, and procedurally generated dungeons, no two runs are ever the same. Test your strategies, refine your builds, and challenge higher difficulties as you master the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon awaits\u2014will you conquer the final floor, or be lost to the depths?</p>","developers":["Family Devs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968290/81e5d9e15955397af941663f529f66a16e6f560f/header.jpg?t=1772737153","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2968290/1990585549/eec7b25e90dad97ca26c2346b40e060516bab6e5/1772542389/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772736977","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2968290/1990585549/eec7b25e90dad97ca26c2346b40e060516bab6e5/1772542389/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772736977","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2968290/1990585549/eec7b25e90dad97ca26c2346b40e060516bab6e5/1772542389/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772736977","id":257297221,"name":"Cards and Dungeons - Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257297221/c3becf6b69e591308e0fd8f6a97593684ff50c05/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772736977"}],"name":"Cards and Dungeons","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_